# The shared lines, Phase 8 session 3 (Docs/Design/84 §33): the wagons the topic draw finds thinnest (talk.caravan):
# a wagon due (13 openers before this, the most-heard caravan kind of Phase 8 session 2's card), late (5), and the word
# the last one brought (2). The rest of the caravan topic fell to the authored route ("A day like any other.") 407
# times in session 2's card and 22 in session 3's first smoke run; these are its other ways to be said. The openers
# carry the concept (§33.1) and hand on as economy8_roads.talk's do: caravan.due_answer for one due, caravan.answer
# for the rest ({rd=why} where the line gives the late wagon's cause).
#
# The facts (Core/RatwAmbient.cpp World::sceneTopics): topic.kind (due, late, news), topic.where (the town at the
# road's other end, "Larkfield"), topic.what (its first good, mid-sentence: "nails", "hides"), topic.who (the carter's
# name; no pronoun is known for them), topic.when (a wagon due: today or soon), topic.why (a late one's cause, "a
# broken axle"), topic.news (what the last wagon brought word of: "berries are dear in Coldwater").
#
# The rules they keep: nothing of the road the facts don't give (no bandits for a late wagon unless world.bandits says
# so); the carter by name only; who says it by the grammar, what about by the criteria.

## ================================================================ A wagon due

rule s83v_due_1
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #s8_heard# There's a wagon due from #topic.where#. | The #topic.where# wagon's on its way. | A wagon's posted from #topic.where#, the board says.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_2
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say We've a wagon coming in from #topic.where#. | Keep an eye on the road. #topic.where#'s wagon is due. | They've chalked up the #topic.where# wagon.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_3
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The #topic.where# road will be busy. A wagon's due. | #topic.where#'s sending a wagon. Good. | Wagon from #topic.where#. That'll fill a few shelves.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_today
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.when=today
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The #topic.where# wagon should be in by dark. | Any hour now, the #topic.where# wagon. | Today's the day for the #topic.where# wagon.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_today2
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.when=today
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Listen for wheels. The #topic.where# wagon's due today. | They're clearing the yard for the #topic.where# wagon. | The #topic.where# wagon comes in today, if the road's kind.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_soon
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.when=soon
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A wagon from #topic.where# in a day or so. | Not long till the #topic.where# wagon. | The #topic.where# wagon's posted. A day or two yet.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_what
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.what
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say There's #topic.what# coming from #topic.where#. | The #topic.where# wagon's bringing #topic.what#. | If you're after #topic.what#, wait for the #topic.where# wagon.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_what2
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.what
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize#, on the way from #topic.where#. | We'll have #topic.what# again when the wagon's in. | The board says #topic.what# from #topic.where#.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_who
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due topic.who
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who#'s bringing the #topic.where# wagon. | The #topic.where# wagon's #topic.who#'s this time. | #topic.who# has the #topic.where# run. Should be in soon.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_carter
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due job=carter
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say I know the #topic.where# road. Good surface, most of it. | The #topic.where# run's an easy one, this time of year. | If the wagon's on the #topic.where# road, it'll be here.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_laborer
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due job=laborer|servant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say A wagon due. There'll be unloading for anyone who wants it. | When the #topic.where# wagon's in, I'll be at the yard. | A wagon means a day's carrying.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_keeper
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due job=innkeeper|cook|brewer|baker
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say I'm waiting on the #topic.where# wagon myself. | The carters will want feeding when they're in. | Wagon day. I'll have a pot on.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_young
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due stage=young|adolescent
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say There's a wagon coming! From #topic.where#! | I'm going to watch the wagon come in. | I want to see what's on it.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_rich
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due wealth=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say One's been told the #topic.where# wagon is due. | One hears the #topic.where# wagon is due. Not that one waits on wagons. | Wagons. One never knows when they'll actually arrive.
then other: caravan.due_answer

rule s83v_due_town
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=due here.region=towns
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A wagon from #topic.where#. #here.town# needs it. | Out here, a wagon's an event. #topic.where#'s is due. | The #topic.where# wagon. Half of #here.town# will turn out.
then other: caravan.due_answer

## ================================================================ A wagon late

rule s83v_late_1
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The #topic.where# wagon's late. #uneasy#. | No sign of the #topic.where# wagon. | The #topic.where# wagon should've been in by now.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_late_2
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Still waiting on #topic.where#. The wagon's overdue. | Late, the #topic.where# wagon. Nobody knows why. | The yard's empty. #topic.where#'s wagon is late.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_late_why
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late topic.why
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {rd=why} #topic.why.capitalize#, I'm told. The #topic.where# wagon's held up. | {rd=why} The #topic.where# wagon's stuck. #topic.why.capitalize#. | {rd=why} Late, the #topic.where# wagon. #topic.why.capitalize#, they say.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_late_who
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late topic.who
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who#'s overdue from #topic.where#. | No #topic.who#, no wagon. Late from #topic.where#. | Anyone heard from #topic.who#? The #topic.where# wagon's late.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_late_merchant
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say Every day the #topic.where# wagon's late, I lose custom. | I've folk waiting on the #topic.where# wagon, and I've nothing to tell them. | A late wagon. My back room's bare.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_late_bandits
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=late world.bandits=near
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The #topic.where# wagon's late, and the roads aren't safe. | With #bandits# about, a late wagon worries me. | Late from #topic.where#. I hope it's only the road.
then other: caravan.answer

## ================================================================ The word the last wagon brought

rule s83v_news_1
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The last wagon brought word: #topic.news#. | Word from #topic.where#, by the wagon. #topic.news.capitalize#. | The carters say #topic.news#.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_news_2
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say News off the road. #topic.news.capitalize#. | Have you heard? #topic.news.capitalize#. That's what the wagon said. | #topic.news.capitalize#, the carters say.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_news_merchant
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news role=merchant
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The carters say #topic.news#. That'll move prices here too. | #topic.news.capitalize#. Worth knowing, in my trade. | A merchant listens to carters. #topic.news.capitalize#.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_news_carter
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news job=carter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say On the road they're saying #topic.news#. | #topic.news.capitalize#. Heard it at every stop. | Road talk: #topic.news#.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_news_keeper
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news job=innkeeper|cook|brewer
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say The carters were full of it at my bar: #topic.news#. | Carters talk over a cup. #topic.news.capitalize#. | #topic.news.capitalize#. That's what the carters had.
then other: caravan.answer

rule s83v_news_old
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=news stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Word from the road, for what it's worth. #topic.news.capitalize#. | #topic.news.capitalize#. Things change out there, too. | The wagons always bring word. #topic.news.capitalize#.
then other: caravan.answer

## ================================================================ The answers

rule s83v_ans_due
when concept=caravan.due_answer
does react.news
say Good. We need it. | #bc_about_time# | I'll be glad to see it. | Let's hope it comes when they say.

rule s83v_ans_due2
when concept=caravan.due_answer topic.what
does react.news
say Then I'll wait for the #topic.what#. | Good. I'm short of #topic.what#. | #topic.what.capitalize#. That'll help.

rule s83v_ans_due_today
when concept=caravan.due_answer topic.when=today
does react.news
say Today? Good. | I'll listen for the wheels. | Before dark, I hope.

rule s83v_ans_news
when concept=caravan.answer topic.kind=news
does react.news
say Is that so? Things move fast out there. | Good to know. | We'll feel it here soon, I expect. | The carters always know first.

rule s83v_ans_news_poor
when concept=caravan.answer topic.kind=news wealth=poor|destitute topic.dir=up
does react.news
say Dear there means dear here, soon enough. | Whatever it is, it'll cost me. | And it'll be us who pay for it.

# (Slice 3, H1: "I'll hear about it when it hits my supper." said to planks, cheap or dear: the poor answer the news as it is.)
rule s83v_ans_news_poor_cheap
when concept=caravan.answer topic.kind=news wealth=poor|destitute topic.dir=down
does react.news
say Cheap there. It's never cheap by the time it gets here. | Cheap somewhere, then. Not here. | Not that I'll see the difference.

rule s83v_ans_news_poor_times
when concept=caravan.answer topic.kind=news wealth=poor|destitute topic.dir!=up topic.dir!=down
does react.news
say News from far off. It never helps us. | Far off. Nothing to do with my table. | Good or bad, it's all one to me.

rule s83v_ans_late
when concept=caravan.answer topic.kind=late
does react.news
say Late's not lost. | It'll come. They always do. | Roads are roads. | I hope the carter's all right.
